# DickieV agent rules

Before doing anything, read `.agent/AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` in full and follow it.

Most important:
- The shell is Windows PowerShell. Separate commands with `;`, never `&&`.
- After any code change, run `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .agent\build.ps1`. You are done only when it prints `BUILD PASSED`.
- Never hard-code `C:\Users\<name>` paths. Use repo-relative paths or `$env:USERPROFILE`.
- Never edit `FIRMWARE_VERSION`. Never commit secrets or `.pio/`.
